            "review_title": "Review at Ngoc Suong Sai Gon (Suong Nguyet Anh)",
            "review_text": "shara\nSeattle, Washington40 contributions\n0\nWorst customer service ever!! And very expensive!\nJul 2023 • Friends\nBeautiful building and ambiance. The food, once we got it an hour after our other friends, was good but steeply overpriced. There was no manager on duty, only one person in the entire restaurant spoke the smallest amount of English. They screwed up our order completely. We kept asking where our food was and pointing to the menus what we ordered and a frantic waiter ran around but never brought it. The other waiter looked at us with such disdain and only said “sorry I speak no English” and walks away. 2 people got their food. 20 min later 2 others got food. One of them was given the wrong food but it was so much effort to use google translate to explain that he just ate it. After 20 more min (an hour after we ordered. 2 of us still sat with no food. When we waved the waiter down pointing to our empty plates he look bewildered, ran off and never returned. I finally got my food, the other guy waited an additional 15 minutes for his. They never apologized, offered a drink or desert for their screw ups. When we went to Pizza 4 P’s, highly recommended, they didn’t have our table ready and gave us all a free glass of champagne and a scoop of ice cream for desert. We never complained or said anything about it and they just took care of us. This place has NO CLUE on basic customer service or how to be a waiter. And this was a very posh expensive restaurant. Don’t go.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 19, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
