            "review_title": "Review at Ngoc Suong Sai Gon (Suong Nguyet Anh)",
            "review_text": "D P\nSaint Cloud, Minnesota19 contributions\n0\nDelicious foods, slow service, but pricey\nJul 2023 • Family\nThis is a luxury seafood restaurant but some good items like groupe fish and beef “la lot” were out when we ordered at around 7:00 pm. The cook forgot what we ordered and delayed serving the meal. Because many items were out, we ended up ordered a crab cooking Singapore style which priced $1,480,000 dong (about $58 dollars). It is very delicious but pricey. We ended up with a bill of $3,100,000 dong (about $130 us dollars) for 2 of us, after the VAT taxes, as expensive as at a sea food restaurant in the USA. The foods are delicious but the service is slow ang the prices are much higher than other seafood restaurants in Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 12, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
